@startuml session-compaction-activity
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Split the view:
pinned = the latest stored system message
  + the prior summary (no summarizer)
  + the preamble before the first turn
turns = the conversation from the first turn on;
if (any turn?) then (no)
  :unchanged;
  stop
endif
:Raw cut by the window:
lastEvents: the last n events
lastTurns: the start of the n-th newest turn
tokenBudget: walk newest to oldest,
  pinned tokens off the budget first;
if (anything before the cut?) then (no)
  :unchanged;
  stop
endif
:Move the cut forward to the next turn start;
if (no later turn start?) then (yes)
  :Move the cut back to the newest turn start;
endif
if (cut at the first turn?) then (yes)
  :unchanged;
  stop
endif
:covered = the turns before the cut
  + every superseded stored system message
preserved = the turns from the cut on;
if (a summarizer is set?) then (yes)
  :summarize(prior summary, covered, preserved);
  if (summary empty?) then (yes)
    :unchanged;
    stop
  endif
endif
:CompactionResult(covered, pinned, preserved, summary);
stop
@enduml
